    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest doesnt really help though. it feels like the more i rest, the more the pile of stuff waiting for me just gets bigger. it's like a debt that's never gonna be paid off. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop where there's no actual way out. everything just feels so heavy.",
